Z||000002||Fformula88||12-04-2000||11:50 PM||||Although it says the Tandem was its own vehicle, I wonder how much truth is in that statement.  It is using a lot of Fiero parts bin pieces, especially the cradle.  Plus its uses the same drivetrain layout as a Fiero.  Could it have been part of a plan to market a platform sharing vehicle under the Chevy name to increase the production volume at the Fiero plant?  Probably not I suppose, but its nice to dream!<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/formula2m6/FIEROSIG1.JPG">  <BR>1988 Fiero Formula||||reg||1
