Z||000004||bHooper||12-05-2000||07:05 AM||||ok, what bothers me about this whole "concept 2000" thing... i don't think it's a concept car!  it sounds a lot more like a kit car.<P>look, if a major auto manufactuar is going to build a concept car, are they going to hide it and show it 20 years later?  hell no.<P>this is some kit car, that someone is trying to market... just look at the list of "parts":<P>Fiero susupension members<BR>koni shocks (when has GM ever done this)<BR>Single piston calipers (if i was doning a concept car it would definatly have dual pistons)<BR>Fiero spindles<BR>Corvet seats<BR>and a Fiero Dash????  why?<P>i say kit car.  a nice looking kit car!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>dont get me wrong, that is a pretty car, in fact, i think i stumbled accross that a while back.  i will have to look later today.<P>hoop<p>[This message has been edited by bHooper (edited 12-05-2000).]||||reg||1
